"""Curated primary provenance and vintage/access limitations used by the offline delivery builder."""
NOTES={
'franklin':('https://vote.franklincountyohio.gov/maps-and-data/gis-shape-files','BOE GIS downloads: separate 2025, 2023 and 2022 sections, eight individually ZIP-wrapped shapefile components per vintage.','889/888/884 features respectively. The 2023 and 2022 counts equal the 2024 and 2022 reporting rosters, but matching counts do not establish a crosswalk. PRECINCTID is not automatically the statewide letter code.'),
'cuyahoga':('https://boe.cuyahogacounty.gov/maps-and-data/interactive-maps-by-city-and-cleveland-ward','BOE Bay Village app c676abf37dfc4f27a23d6258f62b8b11 links webmap 42065a3a00e84159854273743e38b807; shared countywide Voting_Precincts_region layer retrieved without the city app filter.','923 features versus 967/975 native units. Effective date and November 2026 approval unestablished; invalid geometry and overlaps retained.'),
'hamilton':('https://www.cagis.org/Opendata/','Cincinnati Area Geographic Information System official open-data collection, precinct layer 41; county/city GIS publisher identified by service metadata and CAGIS open-data catalog.','563 features versus 562/562 units. CAGIS landing direct HTTP 403; service complete. No county BOE adoption or 2026 crosswalk established.'),
'summit':('https://www.boe.ohio.gov/summit/precinct-and-polling-location-info/maps/','Current BOE map landing is browser-viewable; direct shared-host and summitcountyboe.gov requests return 403. Retained complete official county council map with precinct outlines from a 2010 archive capture.','Historical PDF printed November 5, 2007 is a council map with precinct lines, not a current full precinct package. The archived 420-precinct PDFs were truncated at 1 MiB and excluded. Current and 2024/2022 boundary snapshots remain missing; Census 2020 is a separate statistical reference.'),
'montgomery':('https://www.montgomery.boe.ohio.gov/candidate-tools/','BOE candidate tools references Auditor GIS, mcohio.org/631/GIS-Downloads, then official go.mcohio.org GIS download listing and SHAPEFILE_BOARD_OF_ELECTIONS.zip.','One original ZIP contains 2022-named 497-piece layer and historical 2021/2017/2012 layers (463/459/395). Listing modified June 26, 2026 is publication evidence, not approval. Numeric polygon IDs and split pieces are not statewide reporting-unit codes.'),
'lucas':('https://lucascountyoh.gov/3145/GIS-Maps-Apps-Data','County GIS maps/data landing and official Lucas County ArcGIS organization; Lucas_County_Wards_and_Precincts layer 8 is countywide.','283 features retained. No effective date, BOE adoption, or validated reporting-unit crosswalk established.'),
'stark':('https://scgisa.starkcountyohio.gov/arcgis/rest/services/BoardOfElections/PollingLocationsAndPrecincts/MapServer/1','Official county GIS BoardOfElections service; source attribution names BOE/GIS.','276 features; nine native true-curve records retained unchanged. Polygon-only previews/GeoJSON use a separately retained server linearization. Source invalidities and overlaps remain.'),
'butler':('https://elections.bcohio.gov/maps/precinct_maps.php','Historical BOE 2019 Precinct Shapefile.zip recovered from a February 6, 2021 archive capture. Current Auditor app 022c917993fd4ba482f164f8b0b96ba7 links webmap 6cab8380332948a4a22de12ff3b823f0.','2019 original has 329 pieces, blank/reused STATECODE values. Current BOE direct 403; linked basemap MapServer reports service not started, Hosted folder requires a token. Separate official BCEO tax-map app has no precinct layer. Current and 2024/2022 geometry remain unvalidated/missing.'),
'lorain':('https://www.voteloraincountyohio.gov/maps','BOE map page supplies countywide and city/township PDFs. Retained every linked map PDF with all-page contact sheets.','33 precinct PDFs / 264 pages, plus a separately labeled 5-page Grafton Village ward-map supplement. Countywide PDF creation June 10, 2026; subdivision publication dates vary 2024–2026. Metadata/upload date is not effective approval.'),
'warren':('https://vote.warrencountyohio.gov/','BOE home links official doc/Maps/Voter_Precincts1.pdf.','Complete countywide PDF printed April 14, 2025. No 2026 approval or validated reporting-unit crosswalk.'),
'delaware':('https://gis.co.delaware.oh.us/secondary_nav/main-page-links/','Official county GIS links gisdata-delco.hub.arcgis.com; retained Precincts FeatureServer layer 0.','180 features; native precinctid/name preserved. Current publication alone does not validate the 2024/2022/2026 topology.'),
'lake':('https://www.lakecountyohio.gov/boe/precinct-maps/','BOE page embeds official wpassets.lakecountyohio.gov PDF links.','21 complete PDFs / 21 pages, including separate Painesville City 2023 and 2025 vintages. Printed adoption dates vary 2009–2025; later update/upload dates do not certify November 2026 boundaries.'),
'clermont':('https://gis.clermontcountyohio.gov/download-gis-data/','Official county GIS download listing links maps.clermontcountyohio.gov/gis/VotingPrecincts.zip.','344 original polygon pieces but 168 unique STATEID values; preserve every piece and reused ID. Current listing September 16, 2026 is not approval. An 87 MB historical 2023 archive was listed but not retained; no historical crosswalk asserted.'),
'mahoning':('https://gis.mahoningcountyoh.gov/','Official GIS download page links gisapp.mahoningcountyoh.gov/Public_FTP_Folder/Shape_Files/.','Separate Precincts_2025 (213 features), Precints_2020 (214 features, two empty), and undated Voting_Precincts ZIP retained. Undated ZIP has no PRJ and is not reprojected or assigned another vintage CRS. All native invalidities retained.'),
'medina':('https://www.boe.ohio.gov/medina/','BOE-linked gm.medinaco.org GeoMOOSE config/mapbook exposes public precincp MapServer WFS/WMS. Native GML, capabilities and count controls retained.','203 polygons, no feature IDs or attributes. WFS hits=203, unbounded/high-limit bytes identical, 10-feature control=10. No IDs manufactured. Capabilities incorrectly label projected coordinates as LatLongBoundingBox; original remains unchanged.'),
'trumbull':('https://boe.co.trumbull.oh.gov/boe_maps.html','Working official BOE .gov maps page links pdfs/TC_PrecinctMap.pdf; old .us host failed.','Complete countywide PDF, creation July 22, 2026. No printed effective/adoption date or November 2026 approval established.'),
'licking':('https://gis.lickingcounty.gov/server/rest/services/Auditor/Boundaries/MapServer/2','County Auditor GIS Boundaries precinct layer.','96 features; native PrecinctID and PrecinctName kept; two true-curve features separately linearized for derivatives. No 2026 approval/crosswalk.'),
'greene':('https://gis.greenecountyohio.gov/webgis2/rest/services/OpenData/OpenData/MapServer/20','Official county GIS OpenData precinct layer.','151 features; 86 true-curve records retained in native EsriJSON. Separate server-linearized derivative required for polygon-only displays. Feature count is not a precinct roster or approval.'),
'fairfield':('https://www.co.fairfield.oh.us/gis/','County GIS landing links Fairfield_Data/Precincts.zip; separate official open-data FeatureServer copy retained as another publication.','133 pieces / 111 unique SOS_CODE in direct county ZIP; listing October 12, 2026 is not effective approval. ZIP and service differ in coordinate serialization/topological slivers, so originals remain separate.'),
'portage':('https://www.portagecounty-oh.gov/board-elections/pages/polling-locations','County BOE/GIS routes attempted; retained countywide precinct_2017 layer published by verified City of Streetsboro GIS organization, not mislabeled county GIS.','138 features in historical 2017-named layer (catalog created 2021, modified 2023). Current county BOE download route direct 403; municipal historical publication is not county BOE approval or a current crosswalk.'),
'wood':('https://boe.woodcountyohio.gov/232/Maps','BOE Maps, Cities and Townships pages link countywide, municipal, ward and individual precinct PDFs; 107 additional city/township files retained.','Countywide PDF printed August 24, 2016; many individual precinct maps print June 2024, while some city/ward summaries print January 2010 or July 2016. Every downloaded current-published packet is separately inspected for printed/metadata dates; publication does not imply 2026 approval. Numeric PDF titles are not cross-year join keys.'),
'clark':('https://ago.clarkcountyohio.gov/ccoarcgis/rest/services/WMAS/VotingPrecincts/MapServer/0','Official Auditor GIS WMAS precinct layer.','78 pieces / 76 unique Name2 letter codes; AAA repeats in three pieces. All 76 baseline letter-code strings occur, but geography/2026 correspondence remains unvalidated. Two true-curve records, one invalid geometry retained.'),
'miami':('https://ftp.miamicountyohio.gov/BOE/2014%202016%20Precinct%20Maps/Precinct%20Maps/Miami%20Countywide%20Precinct%20Map.pdf','Official county BOE FTP archive supplies complete countywide PDF.','Printed March 21, 2013. Current BOE direct 403; separately attempted 2017 precinct packet is 404. Current and 2024/2022 boundary versions are missing; Census 2020 reference remains separate.'),
'richland':('https://www.boe.ohio.gov/richland/c/upload/Info_PrecinctMaps.pdf','Official BOE landing links a 166-page precinct-map/street-list PDF. Web research opens it (page 0 MAN 1-A/0100, page 2 MAN 1-B/0110); direct HTTP is 403. Browser screenshot returns a render reference, not downloadable bytes.','No usable county precinct PDF or rendered map asset retained. Historical archive captures truncate at 1 MiB and are excluded. Primary county CamaData/public GIS catalog, IASWOLRD_LGIM, Parcels and Richland_OH_Boundary_Basemap were reviewed by coordinator: no precinct layer found. The service GeopoliticalArea contains six county boundaries; separate official county Drive shapefiles contain 36 GeopoliticalArea city/township/county records and eight CountyDistrict wards/annexes, neither a complete precinct layer. Only official Census 2020 geometry is retained here. All native 2024/2022 Richland units remain without a validated county geometry match.'),
'geauga':('https://gcgis.geauga.oh.gov/arcgis/rest/services/Voting_Precincts/MapServer/0','Verified Geauga County GIS organization app ec316b758a2249dc80c5b29cb11ef07e links webmap 56cdd510fbd9499c80c5946ca40f6fa0, titled Voting Precincts 2026.','80 records, 79 nonempty geometries; OBJECTID 80 City of Chardon D-23 has zero-area/no geometry. This exact gap is retained, no substitute polygon. 2026 app title is not evidence of BOE approval. Historical Census reference has 78 features.'),
'wayne':('https://www.waynecountyoh.gov/precincts-voter-ward-precinct-maps/','Official BOE page returns HTTP 403 with its real current HTML and working HTTP 200 PDF links.','19 precinct PDFs plus one separately labeled school-district supplement. Filenames/creation dates indicate April/June 2026 publication; no printed legal effective date or 2026 crosswalk established.'),
'columbiana':('https://columbiana.boe.ohio.gov/link-resources/maps','BOE-linked county GIS app 88daba67d9a9419ca0b94cf457c9e2d0 -> webmap b4d95d31d76341379d1e0579cc59dd63 -> nested precinct layer in Election_Map_for_App_2022_WFL1.','135 school/precinct pieces, 73 unique NAME values, blank/reused PREC codes. Do not collapse pieces or substitute a Census layer with a similar title; code inventory has unmatched baseline values explicitly listed.'),
'allen':('https://gis.allencountyohio.com/GIS/Downloads.html','Official county GIS download page links img/GIS/Precinct%20Maps.pdf.','Complete 27-page scanned precinct-map packet. Listing updated May 1, 2023; printed effective date unestablished. Every page rendered; no geometry or ID crosswalk inferred from labels.'),
'ashtabula':('https://gis-ashtabulacounty.opendata.arcgis.com/','Verified county Auditor GIS organization item ec5157a03a054487bc64be2cc861e6cc is titled PDF but its actual download is a JPEG.','Original 816×1056 county precinct JPEG printed Adopted February 2013 and February 21, 2013. Historical catalog created 2016, modified 2018; old app services fail. Original clips some right-edge text. No current/2024/2022 county geometry obtained; Census reference separate.'),
'tuscarawas':('https://gis.co.tuscarawas.oh.us/arcgis/rest/services/CountyWebServices/BOE_Precints/MapServer/0','Official county GIS count/all-ID/batches return 81 precinct records, all missing geometry (also null in GeoJSON). PRECT_WEB points to old official BOE Pre-N.pdf URLs; both old host and .gov/current BOE alternatives attempted.','A verified original server-rendered PNG (2000×2600) was recovered via county MapServer export; labels and polygons visible, native EPSG 3734, effective date/approval unknown. This supplies a raster map, not vector polygons. Archive catalog contains 73 official PDF URLs captured in 2016, printed BOE 2010: 16 complete downloads succeeded, 57 connections refused, each failure retained. This is a partial historical packet, not complete current county geometry. Exact missing GIS records and historical PDF paths are in gaps.json. No polygons manufactured; Census 2020 reference remains separate.'),
'erie':('https://auditor.eriecounty.oh.gov/gis-and-maps','Official Auditor GIS page references EC GIS open data; verified Erie County GIS Advisory Board organization publishes EC_Precincts (ERPC attribution).','63 features, catalog created 2016/modified 2017; effective boundary date and current BOE approval unknown. Invalid geometries/overlap diagnostics retained.'),
'muskingum':('https://www.muskingumcountyoh.gov/Muskingum-County-Maps/','Official county maps page links Media/Muskingum-County-Voting-Precincts.pdf; official ArcGIS VotingPrecincts layer separately retained.','68 GIS features / 68 unique STATE_ID codes plus countywide PDF. Letter-code equality is inventory evidence only; current approval/geographic crosswalk unvalidated.')}
